.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Subclass of \fBSolver\fP for linear algebra computations conducted with SAMG, the algebraic multigrid solver for systems of equation from SCAPOS, Fraunhofer, Germany\&. 

Solves the linear algebraic system A x = b using the algebraic multigrid solver DLL from SCAI, Fraunhofer Gesellschaft (St\&. Augustin, Bonn), which can be obtained from SCAPOS\&.

.PP
Up to 2 istances of the DLL can be communicated with\&. Use another instance of the solver if you have multiple PDEs that are solved sequentially and you want to remember SAMG settings from step to step\&.
.SH "Segmentation Fault on some linux based os"
.PP
We have noticed invalid memory access when using dynamically allocated \fBSAMG_Solver\fP objects and their calls to SAMG\&. To avoid that, use static(stack) instantiation\&. Right now we have no idea why, but we're working on that\&.\&.\&. 
.PP
.nf
// i\&.e\&.:
SAMG_Settings settings;
settings\&.Set_napproach(2);
SAMG_Solver samgSolver(&settings);
PDE_Integrator<DIM,Region> pressure_diffusion(&samgSolver);

.fi
.PP

